### List import user reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/import_user_reports
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Upload Excel-Report-001.xlsx
POST {{baseUrl}}/import_user_reports
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_id"

1
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Excel-Report-001.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< D:\Projects\LIMS-Backend\uploads\user_reports\Excel-Report-001.xlsx

------FormBoundary--

### Update import record status (Imported | Validated | Error | Archived)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/import_user_reports/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Validated"
}

### Delete import record (also removes stored file)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/import_user_reports/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
